ng-[0.14em] text-zinc-500" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Free origins</span> <span class="mt-1 block" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>localhost, 127.0.0.1, 192.168.x.x, 10.x.x.x, 172.16-31.x.x, Capacitor, Ionic, ngrok, trycloudflare, CodePen, JSFiddle, CodeSandbox, StackBlitz, Replit, Glitch, Gitpod, GitHub.dev, GitHub.io, VS Code.dev, and Codeanywhere</span> </span> </span> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <!-- Vertical lines --> <div aria-hidden="true" class="border-white/10 pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 mx-auto flex max-w-7xl justify-between border-x" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="border-white/10 relative h-full w-2 border-r" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <div class="border-white/10 relative h-full w-2 border-l" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> </div> </section> <!-- Stats Section Duplicate --> <section class="relative" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="border-white/10 border-y" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="bg-white/10 *:bg-black mx-px grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-px text-center" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-8 px-6 space-y-3 rounded" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg class="h-9 w-9 rounded-[5px] bg-white p-1 text-black" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.75c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.75A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 12 2.714Z" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> <p class="text-sm text-gray-400" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><strong class="text-gray-200 font-medium" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>7-day free trial</strong><br data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>try it in your app</p> </div> <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-8 px-6 space-y-3 rounded" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg class="h-9 w-9 rounded-[5px] bg-white p-1 text-black" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 6.75 22.5 12l-5.25 5.25m-10.5 0L1.5 12l5.25-5.25m7.5-3-4.5 16.5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> <p class="text-sm text-gray-400" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><strong class="text-gray-200 font-medium" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Free for local development</strong><br data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>no credit card required</p> </div> <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-8 px-6 space-y-3 rounded" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg class="h-9 w-9 rounded-[5px] bg-white p-1 text-black" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m3.75 13.5 10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75Z" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> <p class="text-sm text-gray-400" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><strong class="text-gray-200 font-medium" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Setup in under 30 seconds</strong><br data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>add one URL prefix</p> </div> <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-8 px-6 space-y-3 rounded" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg class="h-9 w-9 rounded-[5px] bg-white p-1 text-black" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 0 0 8.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 0 1-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.485 0-4.5-4.03-4.5-9S9.515 3 12 3m0 0a8.997 8.997 0 0 1 7.843 4.582M12 3a8.997 8.997 0 0 0-7.843 4.582m15.686 0A11.953 11.953 0 0 1 12 10.5c-2.998 0-5.74-1.1-7.843-2.918m15.686 0A8.959 8.959 0 0 1 21 12c0 .778-.099 1.533-.284 2.253m0 0A17.919 17.919 0 0 1 12 16.5c-3.162 0-6.133-.815-8.716-2.247m0 0A9.015 9.015 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.605.42-3.113 1.157-4.418" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> <p class="text-sm text-gray-400" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><strong class="text-gray-200 font-medium" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Production-ready infrastructure</strong><br data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>API keys, domains, support</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div aria-hidden="true" class="border-white/10 pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 mx-auto flex max-w-7xl justify-between border-x" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="border-white/10 relative h-full w-2 border-r" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <div class="border-white/10 relative h-full w-2 border-l" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> </div> </section> <section id="how-it-works" class="relative" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="border-white/10 border-y" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="mx-px grid gap-px bg-white/10 lg:grid-cols-2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="bg-black px-6 py-14 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-16" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/80" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>How it works</p> <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
How does<br data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>CORSPROXY work?
</h2> <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-zinc-400" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
Browsers block frontend requests when an API does not allow your website origin. CORSPROXY makes the request server-side, adds the CORS response headers your browser needs, and returns the API response to your app.
</p> <div class="mt-8" data-faq-accordion data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="border-b border-white/10 py-5" data-faq-item data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-free" id="faq-free-trigger" data-faq-trigger data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Is CORSPROXY free to use?</span> <svg class="size-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 transition-transform" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-faq-icon data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> </button> <div id="faq-free" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-free-trigger" data-faq-panel data-open="false" aria-hidden="true" style="max-height: 0px;" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="pt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Yes. CORSPROXY is free for local development and supported development origins. Production website domains require an API key.</p> </div> </div> <div class="border-b border-white/10 py-5" data-faq-item data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-production" id="faq-production-trigger" data-faq-trigger data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Can I use CORSPROXY in production?</span> <svg class="size-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 transition-transform" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-faq-icon data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> </button> <div id="faq-production" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-production-trigger" data-faq-panel data-open="false" aria-hidden="true" style="max-height: 0px;" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="pt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Yes. Add your API key to the proxy URL, authorize your production domain in the dashboard, and choose a production plan for higher limits and support.</p> </div> </div> <div class="border-b border-white/10 py-5" data-faq-item data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-secure" id="faq-secure-trigger" data-faq-trigger data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Is CORSPROXY secure?</span> <svg class="size-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 transition-transform" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-faq-icon data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> </button> <div id="faq-secure" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-secure-trigger" data-faq-panel data-open="false" aria-hidden="true" style="max-height: 0px;" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="pt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>CORSPROXY runs requests through edge infrastructure over HTTPS, with API keys and domain authorization for production usage. Avoid exposing private upstream secrets in browser code.</p> </div> </div> <div class="border-b border-white/10 py-5" data-faq-item data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-data" id="faq-data-trigger" data-faq-trigger data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Does CORSPROXY store my data?</span> <svg class="size-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 transition-transform" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-faq-icon data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> </button> <div id="faq-data" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-data-trigger" data-faq-panel data-open="false" aria-hidden="true" style="max-height: 0px;" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="pt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>CORSPROXY does not persist the proxied response body for normal requests. Requests are processed to fetch the upstream URL and return the response to your app.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-black px-6 py-14 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-16" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="w-[60%] h-[50%] rounded-full bg-emerald-950/40 blur-[60px]" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> </div> <figure class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-[420px]" data-tilt data-tilt-max="12" data-tilt-speed="600" data-tilt-glare="true" data-tilt-max-glare="0.3" data-tilt-start-x="6" data-tilt-start-y="-6" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="bg-zinc-950 border border-white/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-3 bg-zinc-900 border-b border-white/8" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/80" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/80" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/80" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <span class="ml-3 text-xs text-zinc-500 font-mono tracking-wide" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Browser Console</span> </div> <div class="p-5 border-b border-white/5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium mb-3" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Before</p> <div class="flex gap-2.5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="mt-0.5 w-4 h-4 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-red-500/15 border border-red-500/30 flex items-center justify-center" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="text-red-400 text-[9px] font-bold leading-none" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>x</span> </div> <div class="font-mono text-[11px] leading-[1.7] space-y-0.5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="text-red-400 font-medium" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Access to fetch at</p> <p class="text-red-300/60" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>'https://api.example.com/data'</p> <p class="text-red-400" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>from origin 'https://myapp.com'</p> <p class="text-red-400" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>has been blocked by CORS policy:</p> <p class="text-red-300/60 pt-0.5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>No 'Access-Control-Allow-Origin'</p> <p class="text-red-300/60" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>header is present on the resource.</p> </div> </div> <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-4 pl-6 font-mono text-[11px]" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="text-red-500 text-[10px]" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>x</span> <span class="text-zinc-600" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>GET https://api.example.com/data</span> <span class="ml-auto bg-red-950/60 text-red-400 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-semibold border border-red-900/50" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>403</span> </div> </div> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 px-5 py-2.5 bg-emerald-950/20 border-b border-emerald-900/20" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-emerald-500/15" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-emerald-500/60" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-500/70 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>with CORSPROXY</span> </div> <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-emerald-500/15" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> </div> <div class="p-5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium mb-3" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>After</p> <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] mb-4" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="text-emerald-400 text-[9px] font-bold leading-none" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✓</span> </div> <span class="text-zinc-400 truncate" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>GET https://corsproxy.io/?url=...</span> <span class="ml-auto shrink-0 bg-emerald-950/70 text-emerald-400 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold border border-emerald-900/50" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>200 OK</span> </div> <div class="font-mono text-[11px] space-y-1.5 pl-6 border-l-2 border-emerald-500/20" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="text-zinc-500" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>access-control-allow-origin:</span> <span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> *</span> </p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="text-zinc-500" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>content-type:</span> <span class="text-zinc-300" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> application/json</span> </p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="text-zinc-500" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>status:</span> <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> 200 OK</span> <span class="text-emerald-500/70" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> ✓</span> </p> </div> </div> </div> <figcaption class="text-center mt-2.5 text-xs text-zinc-600" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
CORS error eliminated - request succeeds
</figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div aria-hidden="true" class="border-white/10 pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 mx-auto flex max-w-7xl justify-between border-x" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="border-white/10 relative h-full w-2 border-r" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <div class="border-white/10 relative h-full w-2 border-l" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> </div> </section> <section class="relative pt-10 lg:pt-14" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="mx-px" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <!-- Code Showcase with Tabs --> <div class="code-showcase-wrapper" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <div class="px-8 pt-8" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-2 relative inline-block" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> Built for every use case. <svg class="hidden md:block absolute left-full top-0 w-20 h-20 lg:w-[60px] lg:h-[60px] ml-2 mt-4" viewBox="0 0 130 130" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <g clip-path="url(#clip0_304_265)" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.84595 4.08267C66.9712 13.0129 96.6616 67.8584 103.412 125.114C103.53 126.097 104.423 126.804 105.406 126.687C106.389 126.569 107.096 125.676 106.978 124.693C100.042 65.8332 69.2003 9.71002 6.36241 0.530588C5.38376 0.385599 4.47307 1.06527 4.32808 2.04846C4.1831 3.02711 4.86276 3.93769 5.84595 4.08267Z" fill="white" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc></path> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M105.07 123.829C103.207 121.283 100.906 118.061 100.634 117.703C93.2669 108.003 84.7897 99.9652 74.8446 92.888C74.0381 92.3126 72.9144 92.503 72.339 93.3095C71.7636 94.116 71.954 95.2395 72.7605 95.8149C82.4066 102.675 90.63 110.468 97.7751 119.878C98.1919 120.426 103.362 127.671 104.517 129.058C104.988 129.628 105.432 129.805 105.541 129.837C106.112 130.027 106.56 129.914 106.887 129.76C107.254 129.583 107.788 129.144 108.06 128.292C108.341 127.399 108.468 125.415 108.54 124.916C109.655 117.4 110.244 108.913 112.382 101.188C114.421 93.8213 117.874 87.1385 124.792 82.8523C125.635 82.3313 125.893 81.2212 125.372 80.3785C124.851 79.5358 123.741 79.2774 122.898 79.7984C115.164 84.592 111.2 91.9956 108.921 100.228C106.796 107.908 106.153 116.317 105.07 123.829Z" fill="white" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc></path> </g> <defs data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <clipPath id="clip0_304_265" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <rect width="130" height="130" fill="white" transform="translate(5.68248e-06 130) rotate(-90)" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc></rect> </clipPath> </defs> </svg> </h2> <p class="text-lg text-gray-400" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc>Just prefix your URL and make the request.</p> <a href="https://console.corsproxy.io/playground?utm_source=website&#38;utm_medium=home_showcase&#38;utm_content=try_it_now" class="group mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-black transition hover:bg-zinc-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white/40 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-black" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> Try it now <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc></path> </svg> </a> </div> <div class="code-showcase" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <div class="macos-window" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <!-- Title bar --> <div class="title-bar" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <div class="traffic-lights" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <span class="light red" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc></span> <span class="light yellow" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc></span> <span class="light green" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc></span> </div> <div class="tabs" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> <button class="tab active" data-tab="cors" data-astro-cid-t3rdpljc> CORS </button><butt