Your CORS fix is ready
</div> <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">One prefix. Zero CORS errors.</h2> <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mb-6">Prepend the CORSPROXY URL to any blocked API request on your local or development site. Your browser will stop seeing CORS errors immediately.</p> <!-- How it works steps --> <ol class="space-y-4 mb-8"> <li class="flex gap-3"> <span class="shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/15 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-300">1</span> <div> <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200">Copy the proxy prefix</p> <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 font-mono text-xs"> <span class="min-w-0 truncate"> <span class="text-emerald-400" id="modal-proxy-prefix">https://corsproxy.io/?url=</span><span class="text-zinc-500">https://example.com</span> </span> <button id="modal-copy-btn" class="shrink-0 text-zinc-500 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors ml-auto" aria-label="Copy proxy prefix"> <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 17.25v3.375c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-9.75a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V7.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H6.75a9.06 9.06 0 0 1 1.5.124m7.5 10.376h3.375c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25c0-4.46-3.243-8.161-7.5-8.876a9.06 9.06 0 0 0-1.5-.124H9.375c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v3.5m7.5 10.375H9.375a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125v-9.25m12 6.625v-1.875a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375h-1.5a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375H9.75"></path></svg> </button> </div> </div> </li> <li class="flex gap-3"> <span class="shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/15 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-300">2</span> <div> <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200">Paste it before your API URL</p> <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-0.5">
The <code class="text-zinc-400">url</code> value is the blocked API endpoint, not your website domain.
</p> <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-1"> <code class="text-zinc-400">fetch("https://corsproxy.io/?url=" + encodeURIComponent(apiUrl))</code> </p> </div> </li> <li class="flex gap-3"> <span class="shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/15 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-300">3</span> <div> <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200">Free development origins</p> <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-0.5">Browser requests must come from one of these.</p> <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[11px] leading-5"> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">localhost</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">127.0.0.1</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">192.168.x.x</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">10.x.x.x</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">172.16-31.x.x</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">Capacitor</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">Ionic</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">ngrok</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">trycloudflare</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">CodePen</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">JSFiddle</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">CodeSandbox</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">StackBlitz</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">Replit</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">Glitch</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">Gitpod</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">GitHub.dev</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">GitHub.io</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">VS Code.dev</span> <span class="rounded-md bg-white/[0.08] px-2 py-0.5 text-zinc-300">Codeanywhere</span> </div> </div> </li> </ol> <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-950/30 px-5 py-4"> <p class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400">You're good to go — no account needed.</p> <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-500">Copy the prefix above and use it directly. No API key, no signup.</p> <!-- Free-account capture: convert anonymous dev users into known users with a $0 value add --> <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"> <div> <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200">Want usage analytics? Create a free account — still $0.</p> <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-zinc-500">Get your own API key and a live dashboard: requests, bandwidth, and top URLs.</p> </div> <a href="https://console.corsproxy.io/?utm_source=website&utm_medium=cors_modal&utm_content=free_account" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-black hover:bg-zinc-100 active:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors">
